senses.gloss:
लल् (cf. √ लड्) cl. 1. P. (Dhātup. ix, 77) ललति (mc. also ˚ते), to play, sport, dally, frolic, behave loosely or freely, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to loll or wag the tongue (see below) :
Caus. लालयति, ˚ते (Pass. लाल्यते), to cause to sport or dally, caress, fondle, foster, cherish, ib.;
to wave, flourish, Hariv.;
to favour, Sāh.;
 (Ā.) to desire, Dhātup. (cf. under √ लड्).
